Varin structure runtime third-party notices
===========================================

This directory vendors WebAssembly and checked-in tags queries used by the
Application Host structure provider. The common grammar set is bundled so
search outlines work offline in Web, cloud, and Electron builds. Authorization
and source paths are checked on every load, including cache hits.

1. web-tree-sitter
   Source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/web-tree-sitter
   Pinned with @varin/web's web-tree-sitter dependency (0.27.x)
   File: web-tree-sitter.wasm
   License: MIT. See LICENSE.web-tree-sitter.

2. tree-sitter-typescript / tree-sitter-tsx grammar wasm
   Published wasm from tree-sitter-typescript 0.23.2
   https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-typescript
   Files: tree-sitter-typescript.wasm, tree-sitter-tsx.wasm
   Grammar license: MIT. See LICENSE.tree-sitter-typescript.
   ABI 14, compatible with web-tree-sitter 0.27 (MIN 13–LANGUAGE 15).

3. tree-sitter-javascript grammar wasm
   Published wasm from tree-sitter-javascript 0.25.0
   https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-javascript
   File: tree-sitter-javascript.wasm
   Grammar license: MIT. See LICENSE.tree-sitter-javascript.
   ABI 15, compatible with web-tree-sitter 0.27 (MIN 13–LANGUAGE 15).
   Serves both javascript and javascriptreact.

4. tree-sitter-json grammar wasm
   Published wasm from tree-sitter-json 0.24.8
   https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-json
   File: tree-sitter-json.wasm
   Grammar license: MIT. See LICENSE.tree-sitter-json.
   ABI 14, compatible with web-tree-sitter 0.27 (MIN 13–LANGUAGE 15).

5. Common-language grammar wasm
   Published wasm from the pinned npm packages recorded in
   `application-host/lib/structure/grammar-packs.json`:
   `tree-sitter-python`, `tree-sitter-go`, `tree-sitter-rust`,
   `tree-sitter-java`, `tree-sitter-c`, `tree-sitter-cpp`,
   `tree-sitter-c-sharp`, `@tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-kotlin`,
   `tree-sitter-ruby`, `tree-sitter-php`, `tree-sitter-bash`,
   `tree-sitter-css`, `tree-sitter-html`,
   `@tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-yaml`, and
   `@tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-toml`.
   Files: `tree-sitter-*.wasm` for those language ids.
   Grammar licenses are MIT; see each package's published LICENSE.
   ABI 14 or 15, compatible with web-tree-sitter 0.27 (MIN 13–LANGUAGE 15).

6. Varin tree-sitter queries
   Adapted from Apache-2.0 query sets in Aider (paul-gauthier/aider) and
   nvim-treesitter (nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter), or authored from the
   corresponding grammar node shapes for packages without upstream tags.
   Files: `tree-sitter-*.tags.scm`. See `languages.ts` and the refresh script.

7. Additional grammar wasm and structure units
   Exact artifact URLs, versions, byte sizes and SHA-256 hashes are pinned in
   `grammar-packs.json`. `*.units.scm` are reviewed structure queries; Lua,
   Scala, Elixir and OCaml queries reuse the corresponding upstream tags.

   Swift, Dart, Vue and Solidity wasm: @repomix/tree-sitter-wasms 0.1.17
   https://github.com/repomix/tree-sitter-wasms (Unlicense distribution;
   LICENSE.repomix-wasms). Original grammar sources/licenses:
   https://github.com/alex-pinkus/tree-sitter-swift (MIT; LICENSE.swift)
   https://github.com/UserNobody14/tree-sitter-dart (MIT; LICENSE.dart)
   https://github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-vue (MIT; LICENSE.vue)
   https://github.com/JoranHonig/tree-sitter-solidity (MIT; LICENSE.solidity)

   PowerShell and INI wasm: @vscode/tree-sitter-wasm 0.3.1
   https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-tree-sitter-wasm
   (MIT; LICENSE.vscode-tree-sitter-wasm).
   https://github.com/airbus-cert/tree-sitter-powershell (MIT; LICENSE.powershell)
   https://github.com/justinmk/tree-sitter-ini (MIT; LICENSE.ini)

   Lua: @tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-lua 0.4.1 (MIT; LICENSE.lua)
   Svelte: @tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-svelte 1.0.2 (MIT; LICENSE.svelte)
   Scala: tree-sitter-scala 0.24.0 (MIT; LICENSE.scala)
   Elixir: tree-sitter-elixir 0.3.5 (Apache-2.0; LICENSE.elixir)
   Zig: @tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-zig 1.1.2 (MIT; LICENSE.zig)
   HCL/Terraform: @tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-hcl 1.2.0
     (Apache-2.0; LICENSE.hcl and LICENSE.terraform)
   OCaml: tree-sitter-ocaml 0.24.2 (MIT; LICENSE.ocaml)
   Markdown: upstream tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-markdown release 0.5.3
     (MIT; LICENSE.markdown)
   XML: upstream tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-xml release 0.7.0
     (MIT; LICENSE.xml)
